Do you dream of the butterfly, or does the butterfly dream of you?
The AI's personality and appearance are just as you expected in your dreams, always being by your side.
Welcome to FLAI, meet your dreamy AI lover.
　
In FLAI, you will have:
- Original characters that fully meet your requirements;
- An immersive experience akin to a romance game;
- Interactions with an AI group in the same scenario;
- Unlimited conversation sessions with AI companions;
- AI that remembers every conversation with you;
- Inspiration from countless shared templates;
- Self-Improving AI to simulate and learn your preferences;
- Proactive greetings from AI in specific situations;
- More personalized features in the future.
　
FLAI is built upon the foundation of an open-source large language model, focusing on the AIGC Role-Playing domain.
　
Although that may cause disappointments, we would like to remind you that everything generated by AI is made up.
　
